[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
jailgridd runs on each jail host, as root; see jailgridd(8) and the
certificates section of the README at https://github.com/spmzt/geass:

  sysrc jailgridd_enable=YES jailgridd_flags="-l tcp://192.0.2.10:4310 ..."
  service jailgridd start

The console (CONSOLE option) runs kore(1) as an unprivileged user:

  pw useradd jailgrid -d /var/db/jailgrid -s /usr/sbin/nologin
  install -d -o jailgrid -m 0700 /var/db/jailgrid
  edit %%PREFIX%%/etc/jailgrid/kore.conf and web.conf
  sysrc jailgrid_enable=YES && service jailgrid start

Its TLS certificate must be RSA: Kore's key manager signs nothing else.
The first login needs the token in /var/db/jailgrid/setup-token.
EOM
}
]
